{"id":"msg_m_ex_maiden_05","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_maiden","label":"Maiden · Nikke"},"label":"5. Thanks for all your hard work today,","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_maiden_04","next":"msg_m_ex_maiden_06","speakers":{"maiden":"Maiden"},"icons":{"maiden":"si_c181_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_1","text":"Thanks for all your hard work today,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_2","text":"Commander.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_3","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_3","text":"You too, Maiden.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_4","text":"Hehe.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_5","text":"I must confess, even playing games has been a challenge as of late.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_6","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_6","text":"Do you have something on your mind?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_7","text":"Speaking honestly? Yes, it's the mask.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_8","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_8","text":"What about it?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_9","text":"I have to wear it all the time.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_10","text":"Maybe it's because they can't see my expression,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_11","text":"but it seems exceedingly difficult","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_12","text":"to get to know new people.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_13","text":"Even when I go to game meetups,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_14","text":"it feels like everyone is keeping their distance.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_15","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_15","text":"That must be difficult.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_16","text":"It is.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_17","text":"Because of the mask, I feel like people get the wrong impression about me.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_18","text":"It can really get you down sometimes, you know?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_19","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_19","text":"Have you ever heard of the story, The Girl Behind the Iron Mask?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_20","text":"No, I've never heard of it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_21","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_21","text":"The protagonist is a girl who is forced to perpetually wear a mask.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_22","text":"I see.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_23","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_23","text":"Baseless rumors spread about how she hides her face because it's disfigured, and people taunt her.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_24","text":"Poor thing...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_25","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_25","text":"One day, someone rips off her mask, intending it to be a cruel joke.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_26","text":"How could someone do something so horrible?!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_27","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_27","text":"However, behind the mask lay the face of a strikingly beautiful girl.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_28","text":"!!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_29","text":"This is quite interesting.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_30","text":"I feel like there are many parallels between this story and myself.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_31","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_31","text":"I think so too.","jump":"m_ex_maiden_05_33"},{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_32","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_32","text":"Perhaps the story was modeled after you.","jump":"m_ex_maiden_05_34"},{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_33","text":"Truly...","jump":"m_ex_maiden_05_35"},{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_34","text":"You really think so?","jump":"m_ex_maiden_05_35"},{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_35","text":"Ah,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_36","text":"but there's a big difference, though.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_37","text":"The story painted her","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_38","text":"as breathtakingly beautiful,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_39","text":"but that's not exactly me.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_40","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_40","text":"I disagree.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_41","text":"What?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_42","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_42","text":"When I say you and the story are similar, that was one of the key similarities in my mind.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_43","text":"Commander,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_44","text":"will you marry me?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_45","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_45","text":"Excuse me?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_46","text":"I'm honored that you would propose to me in such a romantic fashion,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_47","text":"and my answer...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_48","text":"is yes!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_49","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_49","text":"Um... I didn't mean it that way...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_50","text":"Omg, I'm blushing!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_51","text":"For once,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_52","text":"I'm glad I'm wearing a mask.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_53","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_53","text":"Wait, I...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_maiden_05_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_maiden_05_54","text":"First thing first, we need to find a venue for the wedding.","jump":null}],"chat":true}